{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29150","headline":"送元昼上人归苏州兼寄张厚二首 二 · 许浑","name":"送元昼上人归苏州兼寄张厚二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年无事客吴乡，南陌春园碧草长。\n共醉八门回画舸，独还三径掩书堂。\n前山雨过池塘满，小院秋归枕簟凉。\n经岁别离心自苦，何堪黄叶落清漳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}